      "question": "Which letter never comes at the start of a Turkish word?",
      "options": ["ğ", "g", "ç", "ş"],
      "optionsLang": "tr",
      "answer": 0,
      "explain": "*ğ*, the soft g (*yumuşak ge*), only ever follows a vowel: *dağ*, *doğru*. It has no sound of its own."
    },
