      "optionsLang": "tr",
      "answer": 0,
      "why": {
        "1": "*Hoşça kal* is what the person **leaving** says to the one who stays.",
        "2": "*Günaydın* is good morning."
      },
      "explain": "The one who stays says *güle güle*, literally “smiling, smiling”: go happily. The one who leaves says *hoşça kal*."
